A) We use PESSIMISTIC_FORCE_INCREMENT with @Version.
-> Primarily, We use this while Performing Read Operations like "findById()".
-> PESSIMISTIC_FORCE_INCREMENT forces the version to change even though if we are only performing read operation.
-> Lock + force @Version increment

Example:-
---------
@Lock(LockModeType.PESSIMISTIC_FORCE_INCREMENT)
