Q) Ordered vs Non-Ordered Collections
Ordered Collection:- It maintains the order of the elements based on the sequence in the collection.
Example:- ArrayList, LinkedList, Stack, LinkedHashSet, TreeSet, LinkedHashMap and TreeMap.

