Q) Fail-Fast and Fail-Safe
Fail-Fast:-
------------
-> If the Collection is Structurally Modified during Iteration, throws ConcurrentModificationException.
-> Works on Original Collection.
Examples:- ArrayList and HashMap

Fail-Safe:-
-----------
-> Iterates over copy/snapshot of Collection.
-> Usually Does not throw ConcurrentModificationException.

